,"icon_size":72,"title_type_scale":"medium","text_type_scale":"small","icon_position":"above","mobile_stack":false,"section_height":"medium","color_scheme":"1","full_width":false,"dividers":"none","prevent_animation":false}},"rich_text_4ET6LB":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_FiGraN":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Where to buy breathalysers in Melbourne or Victoria","heading_size":"h2","heading_h1":false}},"text_YMXdQ6":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>If you're looking to <a href=\"https:\/\/andatech.com.au\/pages\/breathalysers\" title=\"Breathalysers\">buy a breathalyser<\/a> in Melbourne, then you're in luck. Based in the eastern Melbourne suburb of Vermont, Andatech is the leading supplier of breathalysers in Australia, and are renowned for reliability and great customer service. With a wide range of breathalysers available, Andatech has something to suit every budget and lifestyle. Andatech's breathalysers are available from many different retailers across Melbourne and the rest of Australia, so you can easily find the best breathalyser for you.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_FiGraN","text_YMXdQ6"],"settings":{"text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-center","mob_center_text":true,"color_scheme":"none","full_width":true,"prevent_animation":false}},"rich_text_CN4zLF":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"heading_rpPh7e":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Buy from breathalyser retailers","heading_size":"h4","heading_h1":false}},"text_RpTy7b":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Visit any of our breathalyser Melbourne retailers to buy a breathalyser in-store. Our personal breath testers are sold in your local Autobarn, Repco, and Autopro shops. Alternatively, you can purchase from online retailers or buy a breathalyser directly from our online store here.<\/p>","enlarge_text":false}}},"block_order":["heading_rpPh7e","text_RpTy7b"],"settings":{"text_position":"justify-center","text_align":"text-center","mob_ce